---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Accessibility" description="Draft accessibility information for the Friends of Ashley website." noindex>
  <PageHero eyebrow="Draft for review" title="Accessibility" intro="FOA aims to make the website usable by as many people as possible." />
  <section class="content-section content-section--compact"><div class="site-width policy-copy"><div class="draft-callout"><strong>Requires testing and formal approval before publication.</strong> This is a draft statement, not a conformance claim.</div><h2>How the site is designed</h2><p>It uses semantic headings and landmarks, keyboard-operable links and controls, visible focus styles, readable text, responsive layouts and reduced-motion support.</p><h2>Known limitations</h2><p>Formal WCAG 2.2 AA testing, representative screen-reader testing, 200% zoom checks and external ticket-provider accessibility review have not yet been completed.</p><h2>Tell us about a problem</h2><p>Email <a class="text-link" href="mailto:thefriendsofashley@gmail.com?subject=Website%20accessibility">thefriendsofashley@gmail.com</a> with the page and problem you encountered.</p></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
